{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5de6c183fe6dc5dcb913d438426cc9806122599a1513eb6bb25a6691a1f7d81d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8db756bfb6e9d85c965c09aeea94e0102a3b6f50029451b298883d62ba6ab9",
      "text": "Mega华丽☆生日！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:343b3f88364a39fa93d18d460038850525b35520728f6d6c4ee42325fe305b1e",
      "text": "被春名问到生日想要什么礼物的四季，\n回答说想要办一场Mega华丽的派对。\n对这方面了解甚少的春名、隼人、旬、夏来等人，\n为了办出四季喜欢的Mega华丽而大费脑筋……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18e4442834f5103ff0d38e6a03e80075dd561dcf7adc94e50e714ffe7483e06a",
      "text": "试着把镜面球打开了……\n不过现在眼前还在闪闪发晕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfcb9c6fe21953dd00229bcb656d33671890f1b56e2544f767644eb444ee191f",
      "text": "过会儿就会好的。\n但是，最好不要在太近的距离看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:412ddd84ba2de829010cccbb7751942f7f4455999f5a43a52de6ddac385286ce",
      "text": "嗯……不过，这样的话四季应该会高兴的……\n我觉得，非常华丽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8be3bbdb46aed6d889bb16ece8e40a4f2660221a0f386c63f65fe51168132b30",
      "text": "邀请函已经给过去了，\n蛋糕也从●●●●プロデューサー那里拿到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae2c04bf4b7abd9caa0ed7368e79879fb43deb5e9d143ec99740550c8b5b8a51",
      "text": "接下来就只剩等待\n派对正式开始了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a9603c1f519c9c45bced076be2b07d72167d608f78a5461fabfaf272e134459",
      "text": "隼人亲，这个镜面球\n我可以带回家去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:027d492ee8a105a4612abc11dee5f4d464029a3c60f1168a091a083903aac576",
      "text": "我倒是无所谓啦，你拿回去干嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c659a788110966d7e5a33f93a42588a2608c9c35af6438f3b2f4b5240977d6d",
      "text": "当然是放在房间里让它发光啦！\n有了这个肯定每天都像在开派对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e80e65e49329b59eaafb5c69134d03f7d3889bec59f9d9bba26d712a6138ca9",
      "text": "哈哈，确实。光是像这样看着\n总觉得就变得开心起来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13d10e230dcce4421aec8cc4409312bfe6e77ef8db26242d686b39b0e3d91025",
      "text": "我偶尔也会带去活动室的，在写歌遇到瓶颈的时候，\n就用这个让心情嗨起来吧～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12514e5b7675d774ed20aa9da29b3ac83735557e4e9577a5f5566bf061104492",
      "text": "这个镜面球的彩虹光芒，\n真的Mega Mega赞啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97254c7e1fb2a80e2ed6773ecbca3521349353fa165cbbd536c76801f57d92a7",
      "text": "我们可是好好向老师征求了许可\n才打开让它发光的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dcb2d067571370a246e7c206d0e5d4e722532b386684066694519e949b89c44",
      "text": "哦，真不愧是优等生旬亲！\n有一手嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:262ef69d6454bc01d0e5cea3881691ddb748b0cc939a09cf77d32e26faaa5a4e",
      "text": "……因为我不希望不仅四季君，\n连我也一起挨骂啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fd8fcfb20dc4b226bcbf4235318d56abd3d9808293a37e4067500ed93325aa7",
      "text": "虽然没能搞成惊喜，\n但尽全力去做了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9821fee671c272e181a7f8f99be4058a2d60d0eb38a9c9f126c8101c9d2ed34",
      "text": "华丽的蛋糕……原本还在想会是什么味道……\n不过……非常好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfaa38d4e55d128eb9034a50cc0b3f78f50f55398c8bf43ae68904a2373f5b82",
      "text": "就是说啊！奶油和海绵蛋糕都\n松松软软的……我也还想再吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b9fe2ab1e0a761ff934732ca21953acabadcc2667b5f98f11c81afdbe6f7f2d",
      "text": "下次就由我去排队买回来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:048269f9f27bd4505da71d4d92319ee92771106a6646b174a304be13977b2809",
      "text": "还要叫上●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n大家一起吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b60e1b9ce5143f40f9ea73916cc847ce0d8c63e5a343f090cb7c850672a2aac",
      "text": "……嗯。\n很期待呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8387623e0499b6c25caf3082b7e34cc6ef25e19032ddca1394a6ea0a026e8a93",
      "text": "邀请函的装饰是我做的。\n觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a48bf4fbe972a0cb366722d8f7335e5a7bea5a77d1b51670a77519303271386d",
      "text": "不愧是春名亲！\n品味真好啊～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca7e43eb392e2e031e795d23ad714ae8660ae9ad13a4b8181a8471b79efdc440",
      "text": "嘿嘿，你喜欢的话\n那就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b73e99f50a22222ded58ab67ee1693ddbf1a5b484ac1f3e53936d2b98edee4c",
      "text": "总之是奔着四季会喜欢的风格去做的，\n这下我就放心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_024shk_2_1_2_024_12:1_2_024_12_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72bca84eb372ee4d3aa5a70ff4a2041c351a2f5abb63553316e572c4c6b1b89b",
      "text": "原来是这样啊……！\n这张卡片我会一直留着的～",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
